      "writtenOn": "2022-03-09T23:53:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m worried these getters have inconsistent behavior with getServerAddr and getUserIdentity. When the profile with built with IkeTunnelConnectionParams, the getServerAddr and getUserIdentity will still return values in IkeTunnelConnectionParams, but all the highlighted getters will return null even if this IkeTunnelConnectionParams is configured with those parameters. It might be confusing to the API caller.\n\nAnd also I think we should have a getter to retrieve IkeTunnelConnectionParams.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 299,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 354,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "1dfd0c72f4f36c474ad60937f0aa16f996c6a282",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
