      "writtenOn": "2022-03-09T23:53:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If caller build the profile with IkeTunnelConnectionParams and then since caller cannot call setAllowedAlgorithms, this getter will always return DEFAULT_ALGORITHMS but IkeTunnelConnectionParams might allow different algorithms, which will be confusing",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 363,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 366,
        "endChar": 5
