      "writtenOn": "2022-03-31T22:05:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes it is a similar concern as the comment above.\n\nI think those getters should have consistent behaviors. When IkeTunnelConnectionParams is set, they should either all return null, or all return correct values. We shouldn\u0027t have some of them return null (e.g. getUserCert), some returns wrong values (e.g. getAllowedAlgorithms) and some returns correct values (e.g. getServerAddr).",
      "parentUuid": "0c37e387_bb7e24ba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 363,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 366,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "1dfd0c72f4f36c474ad60937f0aa16f996c6a282",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
